# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P16, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0.
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
press SEL
tapkey w15
release SEL
tapkey w7
tap PLAY
wait 3000
wait 1500
turn K2 -15 60
wait 2000
press SEL
tap PLAY
release SEL
wait 4000
shot bare-0.png
tap HOME
turn K3 1 60
wait 2500
turn K3 -1 60
wait 1500
tap EDIT
tap EDIT
turn K1 30 60
wait 3000
tap LFO
turn K2 40 50
turn ALGO 40 50
wait 4500
shot bare-1.png
tap FX
turn K2 30 50
turn K4 30 50
wait 4500
